# ToDo Class Diagram

```mermaid

classDiagram

    
    class ToDoBoard {
        +list statusColumn
        +createColumn(str)
        +removeColumn(int)
        +getStatusColumns() list
    }
    
    class ToDoNote {
        +str content
        +setContent()
        +getContent() str
    }

    class StatusColumn {
        +str title
        +list notes
        +getName() str
        +setName()
        +getNotes() str
        +setNotes()
    }

    ToDoBoard "1" o-- "*" StatusColumn : creates
    StatusColumn "1" *-- "*" ToDoNote
```
